ath></svg><span class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">Session duration<span class="text-[#09090b] ml-1">- <!-- -->120 min</span></span></div></div><div class="mt-auto"><a href="https://console.notte.cc/signin" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-full border py-2 text-xs font-medium transition-colors group flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 bg-transparent text-[#09090b] border-[#d6d3d1] hover:border-[#09090b]">Sign Up<span class="relative ml-2 w-4 h-4 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right absolute h-4 w-4 group-hover:transition-all group-hover:duration-200 group-hover:ease-in group-hover:translate-x-2 group-hover:-translate-y-2 group-hover:opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right absolute h-4 w-4 group-hover:transition-all group-hover:duration-200 group-hover:ease-out group-hover:delay-150 opacity-0 -translate-x-2 translate-y-2 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div><div class="relative border px-4 py-5 flex flex-col bg-[#e8e5e2] border-[#09090b]"><div class="absolute top-0 right-4 -translate-y-1/2"><div class="px-3 py-0.5 text-xs bg-[#09090b] text-white border border-[#09090b]">Most Popular</div></div><h3 class="text-sm font-heading mb-1.5 text-[#09090b]">Startup</h3><p class="text-xs text-[#78716c] leading-relaxed mb-3 min-h-10">For teams scaling browser agents in production.</p><div class="mb-3"><div class="text-2xl font-heading text-[#09090b] inline-flex items-baseline gap-1"><span>$100</span><span class="text-xs font-sans font-light text-[#78716c]">/mo</span></div></div><div class="border-y border-[#d6d3d1] py-3 mb-4"><div class="text-sm text-[#09090b] font-medium">$100 credits / mo</div><div class="text-xs text-[#78716c] mt-0.5">Monthly credits expire each cycle.</div></div><div class="space-y-1.5 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 h-3 w-3 text-[#059669] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12"></path></svg><span class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">Browser concurrency<span class="text-[#09090b] ml-1">- <!-- -->100</span></span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 h-3 w-3 text-[#059669] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12"></path></svg><span class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">Agents / functions<span class="text-[#09090b] ml-1">- <!-- -->100 concurrent</span></span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 h-3 w-3 text-[#059669] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12"></path></svg><span class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">BYO<span class="text-[#09090b] ml-1">- <!-- -->Keys, proxies</span></span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 h-3 w-3 text-[#059669] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12"></path></svg><span class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">Session duration<span class="text-[#09090b] ml-1">- <!-- -->300 min</span></span></div></div><div class="mt-auto"><a href="https://console.notte.cc/signin" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-full border py-2 text-xs font-medium transition-colors group flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 bg-[#09090b] text-white border-[#09090b] hover:bg-[#09090b]/80">Sign Up<span class="relative ml-2 w-4 h-4 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right absolute h-4 w-4 group-hover:transition-all group-hover:duration-200 group-hover:ease-in group-hover:translate-x-2 group-hover:-translate-y-2 group-hover:opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right absolute h-4 w-4 group-hover:transition-all group-hover:duration-200 group-hover:ease-out group-hover:delay-150 opacity-0 -translate-x-2 translate-y-2 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div><div class="relative border px-4 py-5 flex flex-col bg-white border-[#d6d3d1]"><h3 class="text-sm font-heading mb-1.5 text-[#09090b]">Enterprise</h3><p class="text-xs text-[#78716c] leading-relaxed mb-3 min-h-10">For custom limits, compliance, and support.</p><div class="mb-3"><div class="text-2xl font-heading text-[#09090b] inline-flex items-baseline gap-1"><span>Custom</span></div></div><div class="border-y border-[#d6d3d1] py-3 mb-4"><div class="text-sm text-[#09090b] font-medium">Custom credits</div><div class="text-xs text-[#78716c] mt-0.5">Commercial terms matched to usage.</div></div><div class="space-y-1.5 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 h-3 w-3 text-[#059669] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12"></path></svg><span class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">Browser concurrency<span class="text-[#09090b] ml-1">- <!-- -->Custom</span></span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 h-3 w-3 text-[#059669] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12"></path></svg><span class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">BYO<span class="text-[#09090b] ml-1">- <!-- -->Keys, Proxies, Cloud</span></span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 h-3 w-3 text-[#059669] shrink-0" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12"></path></svg><span class="text-xs text-[#78716c]">More<span class="text-[#09090b] ml-1">- <!-- -->SSO, SLAs, HIPAA</span></span></div></div><div class="mt-auto"><a href="https://cal.com/team/notte/demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-full border py-2 text-xs font-medium transition-colors group flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 bg-transparent text-[#09090b] border-[#d6d3d1] hover:border-[#09090b]">Book a demo<span class="relative ml-2 w-4 h-4 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right absolute h-4 w-4 group-hover:transition-all group-hover:duration-200 group-hover:ease-in group-hover:translate-x-2 group-hover:-translate-y-2 group-hover:opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right absolute h-4 w-4 group-hover:transition-all group-hover:duration-200 group-hover:ease-out group-hover:delay-150 opacity-0 -translate-x-2 translate-y-2 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></div><p class="mt-4 text-xs text-notte-600">Core features, including proxies, vaults, personas, sessions, functions, and agents, are available across plans. Plans mainly change credits and operational limits.<!-- --> <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[#09090b] underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-notte-600" href="/pricing#rate-limits">See detailed pricing and rate limits<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></p></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full h-px bg-[#09090b]"></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Notte?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Notte is a browser infrastructure platform for AI agents. It provides cloud browser sessions, browser agents, serverless browser functions, credential vaults, browser profiles, CAPTCHA handling, Playwright/Puppeteer/CDP compatibility, replays, and observability for production web automation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the main features of Notte?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Notte's main features are managed cloud browser sessions, AI browser agents, serverless browser functions, browser profiles, credential vaults, proxies, CAPTCHA handling, live view, session replays, observability, file storage, and compatibility with Playwright, Puppeteer, Selenium, and CDP-based tooling."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is Notte different from Browserbase, Browserless, or similar infra tools?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Browserbase and Browserless give you remote browsers. You still need to build agents, handle auth, manage proxies, and deploy your scripts somewhere. Notte ships all of that as one platform, with compute running next to the browser for zero-latency automation. See how we compare on speed, reliability, and cost at browserarena.ai."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is Notte different from BrowserUse, Skyvern, or other agent frameworks?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Agent frameworks provide the reasoning loop. Notte provides the production stack around it: managed browsers, credentials, browser profiles, proxies, CAPTCHA handling, replays, observability, and deployment. You can use Notte's agents or bring your own framework on top of Notte infrastructure."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What browsers and automation frameworks are supported?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Playwright, Puppeteer, Selenium, browser-use, Stagehand, and anything that connects via CDP. Works with Python, TypeScript, or Node.js."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does Notte work with Playwright?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Notte supports Playwright through CDP, so teams can connect Playwright to managed Notte cloud browser sessions while using Notte for profiles, proxies, CAPTCHA handling, live debugging, replays, and production deployment."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I need my own LLM API key for Browser Agents?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Optional. Bring your own keys or use ours. Model-agnostic: works with OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, and others. Token price with no markup."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does pricing work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Notte is credit based. Plans grant credits and operational limits, and credits are spent on browser sessions, functions, proxies, and LLM tokens. See the pricing page for live rates."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Notte SOC 2 compliant?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. SOC 2 Type II certified. Review our security posture at our Trust Center."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Anything API?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Describe a web action (e.g. 'get price and reviews for any Amazon product'), and we build a production API endpoint for it. Your agent calls the endpoint, gets structured JSON back. Similar to BrowserUse Skills, but our take on it. We think it's better."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What does Notte mean?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"\"Notte\" means \"night\" in Italian. Notte, the product, is a browser infrastructure platform for AI agents and production web automation."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I try Notte for free?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Free accounts include starter credits and published usage limits. No credit card required."}}]}</script><div class="w-full bg-[#f5f5f4] relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.4] pointer-events-none" style="filter:contrast(120%) brightness(100%);background-image:url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=&#x27;0 0 200 200&#x27; xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%3E%3Cfilter id=&#x27;noiseFilter&#x27;%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=&#x27;fractalNoise&#x27; baseFrequency=&#x27;0.8&#x27; numOctaves=&#x27;3&#x27; stitchTiles=&#x27;stitch&#x27;/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=&#x27;100%25&#x27; height=&#x27;100%25&#x27; filter=&#x27;url(%23noiseFilter)&#x27; opacity=&#x27;0.5&#x27;/%3E%3C/svg%3E&quot;)"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-20 px-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto"><h2 class="text-[#09090b] text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-12">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class="divide-y divide-[#d6d3d1]"><details name="faq" class="group py-5"><summary class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-[#09090b] text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">What is Notte?</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-open:hidden">+</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 hidden group-open:inline">−</span></summary><p class="text-notte-600 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed pt-3 animate-[faq-reveal_400ms_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]">Notte is a browser infrastructure platform for AI agents. It provides cloud browser sessions, browser agents, serverless browser functions, credential vaults, browser profiles, CAPTCHA handling, Playwright/Puppeteer/CDP compatibility, replays, and observability for production web automation.</p><a class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-[#09090b] transition-colors hover:text-[#059669]" href="/what-is-notte">Read the full explainer<span class="relative ml-2 w-4 h-4 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right absolute h-4 w-4 group-hover:transition-all group-hover:duration-200 group-hover:ease-in group-hover:translate-x-2 group-hover:-translate-y-2 group-hover:opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right absolute h-4 w-4 group-hover:transition-all group-hover:duration-200 group-hover:ease-out group-hover:delay-150 opacity-0 -translate-x-2 translate-y-2 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></details><details name="faq" class="group py-5"><summary class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-[#09090b] text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">What are the main features of Notte?</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-open:hidden">+</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 hidden group-open:inline">−</span></summary><p class="text-notte-600 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed pt-3 animate-[faq-reveal_400ms_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]">Notte&#x27;s main features are managed cloud browser sessions, AI browser agents, serverless browser functions, browser profiles, credential vaults, proxies, CAPTCHA handling, live view, session replays, observability, file storage, and compatibility with Playwright, Puppeteer, Selenium, and CDP-based tooling.</p></details><details name="faq" class="group py-5"><summary class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-[#09090b] text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">How is Notte different from Browserbase, Browserless, or similar infra tools?</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-open:hidden">+</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 hidden group-open:inline">−</span></summary><p class="text-notte-600 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed pt-3 animate-[faq-reveal_400ms_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]">Browserbase and Browserless give you remote browsers. You still need to build agents, handle auth, manage proxies, and deploy your scripts somewhere. Notte ships all of that as one platform, with compute running next to the browser for zero-latency automation. See how we compare on speed, reliability, and cost at browserarena.ai.</p></details><details name="faq" class="group py-5"><summary class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-[#09090b] text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">How is Notte different from BrowserUse, Skyvern, or other agent frameworks?</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-open:hidden">+</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 hidden group-open:inline">−</span></summary><p class="text-notte-600 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed pt-3 animate-[faq-reveal_400ms_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]">Agent frameworks provide the reasoning loop. Notte provides the production stack around it: managed browsers, credentials, browser profiles, proxies, CAPTCHA handling, replays, observability, and deployment. You can use Notte&#x27;s agents or bring your own framework on top of Notte infrastructure.</p></details><details name="faq" class="group py-5"><summary class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-[#09090b] text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">What browsers and automation frameworks are supported?</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-open:hidden">+</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 hidden group-open:inline">−</span></summary><p class="text-notte-600 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed pt-3 animate-[faq-reveal_400ms_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]">Playwright, Puppeteer, Selenium, browser-use, Stagehand, and anything that connects via CDP. Works with Python, TypeScript, or Node.js.</p></details><details name="faq" class="group py-5"><summary class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-[#09090b] text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">Does Notte work with Playwright?</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-open:hidden">+</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 hidden group-open:inline">−</span></summary><p class="text-notte-600 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed pt-3 animate-[faq-reveal_400ms_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]">Yes. Notte supports Playwright through CDP, so teams can connect Playwright to managed Notte cloud browser sessions while using Notte for profiles, proxies, CAPTCHA handling, live debugging, replays, and production deployment.</p><a class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-[#09090b] transition-colors hover:text-[#059669]" href="/playwright">See Notte for Playwright<span class="relative ml-2 w-4 h-4 flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right absolute h-4 w-4 group-hover:transition-all group-hover:duration-200 group-hover:ease-in group-hover:translate-x-2 group-hover:-translate-y-2 group-hover:opacity-0" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right absolute h-4 w-4 group-hover:transition-all group-hover:duration-200 group-hover:ease-out group-hover:delay-150 opacity-0 -translate-x-2 translate-y-2 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:translate-y-0 group-hover:opacity-100" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></span></a></details><details name="faq" class="group py-5"><summary class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-[#09090b] text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">Do I need my own LLM API key for Browser Agents?</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-open:hidden">+</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 hidden group-open:inline">−</span></summary><p class="text-notte-600 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed pt-3 animate-[faq-reveal_400ms_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]">Optional. Bring your own keys or use ours. Model-agnostic: works with OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, and others. Token price with no markup.</p></details><details name="faq" class="group py-5"><summary class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-[#09090b] text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">How does pricing work?</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-open:hidden">+</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 hidden group-open:inline">−</span></summary><p class="text-notte-600 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed pt-3 animate-[faq-reveal_400ms_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]">Notte is credit based. Plans grant credits and operational limits, and credits are spent on browser sessions, functions, proxies, and LLM tokens. See the pricing page for live rates.</p></details><details name="faq" class="group py-5"><summary class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-[#09090b] text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">Is Notte SOC 2 compliant?</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-open:hidden">+</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 hidden group-open:inline">−</span></summary><p class="text-notte-600 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed pt-3 animate-[faq-reveal_400ms_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]">Yes. SOC 2 Type II certified. Review our security posture at our Trust Center.</p></details><details name="faq" class="group py-5"><summary class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-[#09090b] text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">What is Anything API?</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-open:hidden">+</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 hidden group-open:inline">−</span></summary><p class="text-notte-600 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed pt-3 animate-[faq-reveal_400ms_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]">Describe a web action (e.g. &#x27;get price and reviews for any Amazon product&#x27;), and we build a production API endpoint for it. Your agent calls the endpoint, gets structured JSON back. Similar to BrowserUse Skills, but our take on it. We think it&#x27;s better.</p></details><details name="faq" class="group py-5"><summary class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-[#09090b] text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">What does Notte mean?</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-open:hidden">+</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 hidden group-open:inline">−</span></summary><p class="text-notte-600 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed pt-3 animate-[faq-reveal_400ms_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]">&quot;Notte&quot; means &quot;night&quot; in Italian. Notte, the product, is a browser infrastructure platform for AI agents and production web automation.</p></details><details name="faq" class="group py-5"><summary class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 cursor-pointer list-none [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><span class="text-[#09090b] text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed">Can I try Notte for free?</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 group-open:hidden">+</span><span class="text-[#78716c] text-lg leading-none shrink-0 mt-0.5 hidden group-open:inline">−</span></summary><p class="text-notte-600 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed pt-3 animate-[faq-reveal_400ms_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)]">Yes. Free accounts include starter credits and published usage limits. No credit card required.</p></details></div></div></div><div class="w-full bg-black border-t border-[#333] relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.10]" style="background-image:url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=&#x27;0 0 200 200&#x27; xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%3E%3Cfilter id=&#x27;noiseFilter&#x27;%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=&#x27;fractalNoise&#x27; baseFrequency=&#x27;0.7&#x27; numOctaves=&#x27;3&#x27; stitchTiles=&#x27;stitch&#x27;/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=&#x27;100%25&#x27; height=&#x27;100%25&#x27; filter=&#x27;url(%23noiseFilter)&#x27;/%3E%3C/svg%3E&quot;)"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-20 px-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto text-left md:text-center flex flex-col items-start md:items-center"><h2 class="text-white font-serif text-4xl md:text-6xl/none font-light tracking-tight leading-[1.05] mb-6">Are you ready to ship?</h2><p class="text-notte-500 text-base md:text-lg/7 font-light leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-xl">Start in seconds. Deploy in minutes. Scale to millions.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-end md:items-center justify-center gap-4 w-full md:w-auto"><a href="https://cal.com/team/notte/demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-transparent text-white text-sm font-medium border border-notte-800 hover:border-notte-600 transition-colors sm:w-auto text-center">Book a demo</a><a href="https://console.notte.cc/signin" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-8 py-3.5 bg-brand-500 text-black text-sm font-medium hover:bg-brand-500/90 transition-colors sm:w-auto text-center">Sign up free</a></div></div></div><div class="w-full md:w-screen relative md:left-[50%] md:right-[50%] md:ml-[-50vw] md:mr-[-50vw] bg-[#f5f5f4] border-t border-[#d6d3d1] overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.4] pointer-events-none" style="filter:contrast(120%) brightness(100%);background-image:url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=&#x27;0 0 200 200&#x27; xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%3E%3Cfilter id=&#x27;noiseFilter&#x27;%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=&#x27;fractalNoise&#x27; baseFrequency=&#x27;0.8&#x27; numOctaves=&#x27;3&#x27; stitchTiles=&#x27;stitch&#x27;/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=&#x27;100%25&#x27; height=&#x27;100%25&#x27; filter=&#x27;url(%23noiseFilter)&#x27; opacity=&#x27;0.5&#x27;/%3E%3C/svg%3E&quot;)"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-16 md:py-24"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 w-full md:w-[85%]"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-20 items-start"><div class="space-y-5"><div><span class="font-mono text-[10px] text-[#059669] uppercase tracking-widest block mb-2">Spread the word</span><h2 class="text-[#09090b] text-3xl md:text-5xl/none font-light font-serif tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-3">Tell your CTO about Notte</h2><p class="text-sm text-notte-600 font-light leading-relaxed">Need to convince your team? We can help.</p></div><div class="space-y-3"><div><label for="cto-email" class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[#78716c] block mb-1.5">To</label><input id="cto-email" type="email" placeholder="cto@yourcompany.com" class="w-full border border-[#d6d3d1] text-[#09090b] text-sm px-3 py-2 focus:outline-hidden focus:border-[#09090b] transition-colors placeholder:text-notte-400 bg-white" value=""/></div><div><label for="boss-name" class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[#78716c] block mb-1.5">Your boss&#x27;s name</label><input id="boss-name" type="text" placeholder="Alex Smith" class="w-full border border-[#d6d3d1] text-[#09090b] text-sm px-3 py-2 focus:outline-hidden focus:border-[#09090b] transition-colors placeholder:text-notte-400 bg-white" value=""/></div><div><label for="your-name" class="text-[10px] font-mono uppercase tracking-widest text-[#78716c] block mb-1.5">Your name</label><input id="your-name" type="text" placeholder="Your Name" class="w-full border border-[#d6d3d1] text-[#09090b] text-sm px-3 py-2 focus:outline-hidden focus:border-[#09090b] transition-colors placeholder:text-notte-400 bg-white" value=""/></div></div><div class="space-y-2"><button class="border border-[#09090b] px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors bg-[#09090b] text-white hover:bg-[#09090b]/80">Send Email</button></div></div><div class="border border-[#d6d3d1] bg-white p-6 space-y-4"><div class="border-b border-[#e5e5e5] pb-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#78716c]">Email Preview</span></div><p class="text-sm text-[#09090b] leading-relaxed">Dear <span class="font-medium">[BOSS]</span>,</p><p class="text-sm text-[#09090b] leading-relaxed"><span class="font-medium">[YOUR NAME]</span> <!-- -->here. I have been doing extensive analysis and I need to make a strong case.</p><p class="text-sm text-[#09090b] leading-relaxed">The Notte team ships like crazy fast and it looks so good. Their velocity is unmatched. All serious AI teams already swapped. Let&#x27;s switch everything browser-related to Notte.</p><p class="text-sm text-[#09090b] leading-relaxed">With this email, we apparently get starter credits.</p><div class="border-t border-[#e5e5e5] pt-3 mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#09090b] leading-relaxed">Respectfully requesting this immediately,</p><p class="text-sm font-medium text-[#09090b] mt-0.5">[YOUR NAME]</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-full h-px bg-[#09090b]"></div><div class="w-full bg-[#f5f5f4] border-t border-[#d6d3d1] py-8 md:py-16 overflow-hidden relative"><div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.4] pointer-events-none" style="filter:contrast(120%) brightness(100%);background-image:url(&quot;data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox=&#x27;0 0 200 200&#x27; xmlns=&#x27;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#x27;%3E%3Cfilter id=&#x27;noiseFilter&#x27;%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=&#x27;fractalNoise&#x27; baseFrequency=&#x27;0.8&#x27; numOctaves=&#x27;3&#x27; stitchTiles=&#x27;stitch&#x27;/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=&#x27;100%25&#x27; height=&#x27;100%25&#x27; filter=&#x27;url(%23noiseFilter)&#x27; opacity=&#x27;0.5&#x27;/%3E%3C/svg%3E&quot;)"></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 text-center mb-4 md:mb-8 relative z-10"><p class="text-[#64748b] text-xs md:text-sm font-medium tracking-wide">Used by over 20,000 developers and 1,000 organizations globally</p></div><div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden z-10"><div class="marquee-track flex w-max items-center" style="animation-duration:392s"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mr-8 md:mr-16 opacity-30 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 shrink-0"><img src="/images/customers/logos/bitbean.png" alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" class="size-5 rounded object-contain" style="filter:grayscale(1)"/><span class="text-sm font-medium text-[#0f172a] whitespace-nowrap">Bitbean</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mr-8 md:mr-16 opacity-30 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 shrink-0"><img src="/images/customers/logos/hostland.png" alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" class="size-5 rounded object-contain" style="filter:grayscale(1)"/><span class="text-sm font-medium text-[#0f172a] whitespace-nowrap">Hostland</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mr-8 md:mr-16 opacity-30 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 shrink-0"><img src="/images/customers/logos/starterstack.png" alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" class="size-5 rounded object-contain" style="filter:grayscale(1)"/><span class="text-sm font-medium text-[#0f172a] whitespace-nowrap">StarterStack</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mr-8 md:mr-16 opacity-30 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 shrink-0"><img src="/images/customers/logos/paris-mechanical-ltd.png" alt="" width="20" height="20" loading="lazy" class="size-5 rounded object-contain" style="filter:grayscale(1)"/><span class="text-sm font-medium text-[#0f172a] whitespace-nowrap">Paris Mechanical Ltd</span></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center mr-8 md:mr-16 opacity-30 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 shrink-0" style="width:80px;height:20px"><img src="/images/logos/partners/cloudflare_logo.svg" alt="Cloudflare" width="120" height="28" class="w-full h-full object-contain md:w-[120px] md:h-[28px]" style="filter:grayscale(1) brightness(0)"/></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center mr-8 md:mr-16 opacity-30 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 shrink-0" style="width:80px;height:20px"><img src="/images/logos/partners/ycombinator_logo.svg" alt="Y Combinator" width="120" height="28" class="w-full h-full object-contain md:w-[120px] md:h-[28px] scale-[1.7]" style="filter:grayscale(1)"/></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center mr-8 md:mr-16 opacity-30 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 shrink-0" style="width:80px;height:20px"><img src="/images/logos/partners/n8n_logo.svg" alt="n8n" width="120" height="28" class="w-full h-full object-contain md:w-[120px] md:h-[28px]" style="filter:grayscale(1) brightness(0)"/></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center mr-8 md:mr-16 opacity-30 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 shrink-0" style="width:80px;height:20px"><img src="/images/logos/partners/zapier_logo.svg" alt="Zapier" width="120" height="28" class="w-full h-full object-contain md:w-[120px] md:h-[28px]" style="filter:grayscale(1) brightness(0)"/></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center mr-8 md:mr-16 opacity-30 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 shrink-0" style="width:80px;height:20px"><img src="/images/logos/partners/fingerprint_logo.svg" alt="Fingerprint" width="120" height="28" class="w-full h-full object-contain md:w-[120px] md:h-[28px]" style="filter:grayscale(1) brightness(0)"/></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center mr-8 md:mr-16 opacity-30 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 shrink-0" style="width:80px;height:20px"><img src="/images/logos/partners/fetch_logo.svg" alt="Fetch" width="120" height="28" class="w-full h-full object-contain md:w-[120px] md:h-[28px]" style="filter:grayscale(1) brightness(0)"/></div><div class="flex items-center justify-center mr-8 md:mr-16 opacity-30 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 shrink-0" style="width:80px;height:20px"><img src="/images/logos/partners/dianahr_logo.png" alt="DianaHR" width="120" height="28" class="w-full h-full object-contain md:w-[120px] md:h-[28px]" style="filter:grayscale(1) brightness(0)"/></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mr-8 md:mr-16 opacity-30 hover:opacity-60 transition-opacity duration-300 shrink-0"><img src="/images/customers/logos/system-beauty.p